    "title": "APEXEL APL-24X New 2 in 1 macro lens 12x/ 24x super macro lens detechable universal clip lens for Xiaomi ios android all smartphone 24XM",
    "body_html": "<div><br></div>\n<div><span><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Apexel apl-24x new 2 in 1 macro lens 12x/ 24x super macro lens detechable universal clip lens for xiaomi ios android all smartphone 24xm\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/IMG_0684.jpg?v=1636024824\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/IMG_0685.jpg?v=1636024833\" alt=\"Apexel apl-24x new 2 in 1 macro lens 12x/ 24x super macro lens detechable universal clip lens for xiaomi ios android all smartphone 24xm\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/IMG_0686.jpg?v=1636024842\" alt=\"Apexel apl-24x new 2 in 1 macro lens 12x/ 24x super macro lens detechable universal clip lens for xiaomi ios android all smartphone 24xm\"></span></div>\n<div><span>Features:</span></div>\n<div><span>1. With high-class glass, easily captured much clearer images. No annoying for dark circle and blurry images.</span></div>\n<div><span>2. The transparent layer circled, thoughtful design for 24X Super Macro lens, to fix the distance when captured tiny things.</span></div>\n<div><span>3. Universal clip, no worry about the bothering of changing lens.</span></div>\n<div><span>4. Soft cushions to protect your cell phone from scratching.</span></div>\n<div><span>5. Included one piece of cleaning cloth, making your lense clear all the time.</span></div>\n<div><span>6. Exquisite packaging makes it perfect for making a great gift. The box also can protect your lens while no using.</span></div>\n<div><span>7. These lenses are suitable for most Cell phones with cameras.\u00a0</span></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span>For example:\u00a0for\u00a0iPhone 6 plus/6/5/5S/4/4S, iPad Air 2/1, iPad 4/3/2, iPad Mini 3/2/1, Samsung Galaxy S6 Edge/S6/S5/S4/S3/A7/A5, Galaxy Note 5/4/3/2, Blackberry Bold Touch, Sony Xperia, Motorola Droid ,Xiaomi Red</span></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span>NOTE:</span></div>\n<div><span>1. 12X Macro Lens and 24X Super Macro Lens are connected together. When you use the\u00a024X Super Macro Lens, the 12X Macro Lens and 24X Super Macro Lens must be screwed together.</span></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span>2. When use the Macro Lens, make sure you do not block light source and suggest keeping 1-2cm distance from your object to take more clear pictures. The 24X Super Macro Lens has a transparent layer to fix distance between the lens and the objects.</span></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span>3. This product might not compatible with all smartphones or tablets, especially some smartphones or tablets with camera on the middle of the devices.</span></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span>When using 24x macro lens, please place it on the surface of the object(1-2cm) you want to shoot;</span></div>\n<div><span>When using 12x macro lens, please keep 2-2.5cm distance from the object you want to shoot.</span></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1-4A-CJIsqpNjUkcnJxxw2aeTFlBIAZyhUXymKpO7g5-6zm6AsM03s9A8xowCdkKzKkFjaPlca9qzdjBE_a_qEASUdAjw47mc6WIEyxH1gTqQt1wDwK9RgiB33T-jrTfQqJHp7zNSi5A3f5kLCHxrOfWdsebBtcI2RWytloHGgOM5tVlj3bXKXm8AEuRUpo9lfgWmc_1A-S53silhYWtmpy-owWZr8wzA9nLJTTTe4-QO8tdI7cHGKmuKpEZRUsETQ4UJxyf8OmVHHlYeYaR8uxeFmsMExIK4yzEOw4ZvUnf7FTF_hG-ND-pMO-k2YEWMadUGPwsmkNYTx-Q6NkRejbVFoZ2aEwSRIVvYinYavDKkEoNfx5FKsyOvBHt3Ez3JEAKYubETueDeNz6Cxvr3l6xPaLjBHHpPkMPhMP3-EOR-SrN8RgJTscjQLYJDZDbh3-xNZp47C48tHHaKM7o7VCJDvn3SMGHFWYL_XkA72qsPuiKxU5STL3Shu9_YgBRoXoohcvDy04byHFNV0cYmvyH3yB3lYxqZLZEGZCr06T_E9F4ypMz0lr78N_zLoX9asIpkYAn-CnKb_wc1Hd5PZIyqipkopsfnxG9yTyOiIS_AO7nU5ByULDwQV88gpwhB9gt_duIBphY38Pq6xv924eg7-gNuXStLP8oSMkuP_JEGNQAas8Owh7WqyyqnEp2UpnTmcnE-a7YyayfZYDGyzOh=w1000-h694-no?authuser=1\"></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span>Package included:</span></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span>1x 12X Macro Lens</span></div>\n<div><span>1x 24X Super Macro Lens (connected with the 12X Macro Lens )</span></div>\n<div><span>1x Lens Clips</span></div>\n<di